msgid "H743 V-only high-clock profile"
msgstr "H743 仅限 V 修订的高频配置"

msgid "Use `hsi64-pll384-cache-off` when a cold STM32H743ZIT6 reference needs distinct CPU, bus and peripheral clock domains. This page explains the current fixed profile, its joint owner and failure boundaries. It covers V revision `0x2003` only, with Cache off. Physical HIL remains `not_executed`; software execution does not measure supply, junction temperature, clock accuracy or communication."
msgstr "冷启动 STM32H743ZIT6 参考配置需要区分 CPU、总线与外设时钟域时，可选择 `hsi64-pll384-cache-off`。本页说明当前固定配置、统一 owner 及失败边界，仅覆盖 V 修订 `0x2003`，Cache 关闭。实板 HIL 仍为 `not_executed`；软件执行不能测量供电、结温、时钟精度或通信表现。"

msgid "One assembly selects one clock owner"
msgstr "一份装配选择一个时钟 owner"

msgid "![FIG-05: current generated Platform lifecycle; arrows describe explicit startup, reverse cleanup and retained responsibilities](../assets/diagrams/platform-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-05：当前生成 Platform 的生命周期；箭头表示显式启动、逆序清理与保留责任](../assets/diagrams/platform-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "FIG-05: current generated Platform lifecycle; arrows describe explicit startup, reverse cleanup and retained responsibilities"
msgstr "FIG-05：当前生成 Platform 的生命周期；箭头表示显式启动、逆序清理与保留责任"

msgid "FIG-05 describes the common Platform lifecycle. For this exact reference, its SoC startup expands to clock owner, System timebase and selected consumers, in that order. The reverse path must withdraw consumers and System before the clock owner. The diagram is not a frequency-transition sequence or physical proof; the exact clock stages below specialize its lifecycle responsibilities."
msgstr "FIG-05 描述通用 Platform 生命周期。对本精确参考配置，SoC 启动依次展开为时钟 owner、System 时基和选定 consumer。逆向路径必须先撤销 consumer 与 System，再撤销时钟 owner。该图不是调频时序或物理证明；下文的精确时钟阶段细化了图中的生命周期责任。"

msgid "One TOML `clock` selection resolves through reviewed [SoC facts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/soc.json) into immutable clock-domain IR. The generated bundle selects the private implementation and CMake selects its translation unit. The typed factory still returns existing static faces without MMIO, allocation, clock setup or discovery. Runtime calls enter the selected provider directly through its shared read-only operations table."
msgstr "一项 TOML `clock` 选择经已审[SoC 事实](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/soc.json)解析为不可变时钟域 IR。生成 bundle 选择私有实现，CMake 选择其编译单元。typed factory 仍只返回已有静态 face，不执行 MMIO、分配、时钟设置或探测。运行调用通过共享只读方法表直接进入选定 provider。"

msgid "The [private clock contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/private/stm32h743_clock.h) owns admission and clock responsibility. [System](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/system.c) owns TIM2 and its vector. The generated [lifecycle glue](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/stm32h743/emission.py) orders them and preserves startup and cleanup diagnostics. Their effect masks are different namespaces; the platform projects retained responsibility without treating the numeric masks as interchangeable."
msgstr "[私有时钟合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/private/stm32h743_clock.h)负责准入与时钟责任，[System](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/system.c)负责 TIM2 及其向量。生成的[生命周期装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/providers/stm32h743/emission.py)规定调用顺序并保留启动、清理诊断。两者的 effect mask 属于不同命名空间；平台投影仍保留的责任，不能把数值 mask 当作可互换标识。"

msgid "Admit an exact cold configuration"
msgstr "准入精确的冷态配置"

msgid "Automatic high-profile admission requires DEV_ID `0x450`, REV_ID `0x2003` (V) and the factory-default HSI user trim. ES0392 Rev15 Table 2 maps `0x1003` to both Y and W, and `0x2001` to X. The reviewed DS12110 Rev11 electrical chapter explicitly covers V; the Y/W ambiguity and lack of an explicitly reviewed X chapter prevent admitting those IDs. They and unknown revisions return `UNSUPPORTED` without acquiring effects. There is no automatic fallback or user-overridable revision allowlist."
msgstr "高频配置的自动准入要求 DEV_ID `0x450`、REV_ID `0x2003`（V）及出厂默认 HSI 用户 trim。ES0392 Rev15 表 2 将 `0x1003` 同时映射到 Y/W，将 `0x2001` 映射到 X。已审 DS12110 Rev11 电气章节明确覆盖 V；Y/W 无法区分，X 又缺少明确审查对应的电气章节，因此不能准入这些 ID。它们与未知修订均返回 `UNSUPPORTED`，不取得效果。没有自动回退或可由用户覆盖的修订允许列表。"

msgid "Startup requires the real reset-owned call sequence before SysTick, a scheduler, I/O or another clock owner has run. Matching register values cannot prove that history. The diagnostic deliberately avoids reading SysTick CTRL because its COUNTFLAG is read-clear; zero LOAD/VAL are not proof that ENABLE is clear. Bootloader adoption and runtime frequency scaling require separate contracts."
msgstr "启动必须遵循实际由 reset owner 控制的调用顺序，发生在 SysTick、调度器、I/O 或其他时钟 owner 运行之前。寄存器值相符不能证明这些历史前提。诊断刻意不读取 SysTick CTRL，因为 COUNTFLAG 是读清位；LOAD/VAL 为零不能证明 ENABLE 已清零。接管 bootloader 和运行时调频需要独立合同。"

msgid "Cold checks include ready LDO/VOS3, inactive Flash pulses and programming modes, reset PLL configuration, quiet consumers and known-clean disabled caches. Readable disabled cache bits do not prove that foreign dirty lines are absent. Supply, temperature, package and PCB cannot be qualified by IDCODE or readback."
msgstr "冷态检查包括 LDO/VOS3 就绪、Flash 脉冲及编程模式未活动、PLL 配置处于复位值、consumer 静止，以及已知干净且关闭的 cache。可读的 cache 关闭位不能证明没有外来脏行。IDCODE 或读回不能建立供电、温度、封装及 PCB 的资格。"

msgid "Keep clock domains and uncertainty separate"
msgstr "分别表达时钟域与不确定度"

msgid "The following are reviewed design bounds, not frequency measurements. CPU and PLL-derived domains include the conservative PLL-ready deviation in addition to the HSI envelope. Unmultiplied HSI kernels do not inherit that PLL multiplier."
msgstr "下列数值是已审设计边界，不是频率测量值。CPU 与源于 PLL 的时钟域在 HSI 包络之外计入保守的 PLL-ready 偏差。未经倍频的 HSI kernel 不承担该 PLL 系数。"

