msgid "The empty profile configures ADC12's input selector but does not initialize an ADC or its divider. TIM2 uses PSC191 for a nominal 1 MHz counter. A software millisecond remains an HSI-derived nominal interval; PSC383 would halve the counter rate and is rejected by the production-model tests. TIM3 likewise uses its actual 192 MHz kernel when admitting an integer tick divisor."
msgstr "空配置设置 ADC12 输入 selector，但不初始化 ADC 或其分频器。TIM2 使用 PSC191 得到名义 1 MHz 计数器。软件毫秒仍是源于 HSI 的名义时间；PSC383 会使计数速率减半，真实生产模型测试会拒绝该错误。TIM3 同样使用实际 192 MHz kernel 准入整数 tick 分频。"

msgid "Where the HSI envelope comes from"
msgstr "HSI 包络的来源"

msgid "[DS12110 Rev11](https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/stm32h743vi.pdf) Table 134, page 232, gives V-cut factory HSI frequency 63.7..64.3 MHz at VDD 3.3 V and junction 30 °C. It separately specifies voltage drift −0.12..+0.03% over VDD 1.62..3.6 V and temperature drift −2..+1% over −40 °C..TJmax. Factory frequency limits use production testing; the full temperature drift uses characterization. These assurance levels remain distinct. The narrower −20..105 °C row is not the full-temperature envelope. Suffix 6 junction limits must not be confused with ambient limits or thermal dissipation."
msgstr "[DS12110 Rev11](https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/stm32h743vi.pdf)表 134、第 232 页给出 V 修订在 VDD 3.3 V、结温 30 °C 下的出厂 HSI 频率 63.7..64.3 MHz，并分别规定 VDD 1.62..3.6 V 下的电压漂移 −0.12..+0.03%，以及 −40 °C..TJmax 下的温度漂移 −2..+1%。出厂频率边界通过生产测试保证，完整温度漂移使用特性表征，二者保证程度不同。−20..105 °C 的较窄行不是完整温度包络；后缀 6 的结温边界不能与环境温度或热耗散条件混淆。"

msgid "Conservative multiplicative endpoints are `63.7 × 0.98 × 0.9988 = 62.3510888 MHz` and `64.3 × 1.01 × 1.0003 = 64.9624829 MHz`. The additive lower estimate `63.7 − 64.3 × (0.02 + 0.0012)` is 62.33684 MHz. The selected 62..65 MHz interval covers these compositions; it is a reviewed engineering envelope, not a literal datasheet interval. RM0433 Rev9's PLL-ready deviation adds the conservative factor 0.98..1.02, yielding `62 × 6 × 0.98 = 364.56 MHz` through `65 × 6 × 1.02 = 397.8 MHz`. The design stays below the reviewed VOS1 CPU/HCLK/APB limits of 400/200/100 MHz. Different source assumptions require a new reviewed profile."
msgstr "保守乘法端点为 `63.7 × 0.98 × 0.9988 = 62.3510888 MHz` 和 `64.3 × 1.01 × 1.0003 = 64.9624829 MHz`。加法下界估计 `63.7 − 64.3 × (0.02 + 0.0012)` 为 62.33684 MHz。选定 62..65 MHz 区间覆盖这些组合，是已审工程包络，不是数据手册原文区间。RM0433 Rev9 的 PLL-ready 偏差再计入保守系数 0.98..1.02，得到 `62 × 6 × 0.98 = 364.56 MHz` 至 `65 × 6 × 1.02 = 397.8 MHz`。设计保持低于已审 VOS1 的 CPU/HCLK/APB 上限 400/200/100 MHz；不同源假设需要新的已审配置。"

msgid "Local UART arithmetic does not qualify a link"
msgstr "本地 UART 算术不能建立链路资格"

msgid "At requested 115200 baud, oversampling 16 and prescaler 1, the selected HSI64 kernel produces BRR556. Nominal baud is about 115107.914; the 62..65 MHz source envelope produces about 111510.791..116906.475 baud, or −3.202438..+1.481315% relative to the request. The lower endpoint already exceeds a hypothetical 2% local budget. Nominal divider accuracy alone cannot establish acceptable communication over the whole source envelope."
msgstr "请求 115200 baud、16 倍过采样、预分频 1 时，选定 HSI64 kernel 得到 BRR556。名义 baud 约为 115107.914；62..65 MHz 源包络对应约 111510.791..116906.475 baud，相对请求值为 −3.202438..+1.481315%。下端点已超过假设的 2% 本地预算。因此，仅名义分频精度不能证明整个源包络内的通信均可接受。"

msgid "The platform checks local divider representability and exposes the selected source bounds. It does not invent a zero-error peer, require product peer-budget fields or silently choose another source. The external product must evaluate the complete transmitter, receiver, quantization, line and wakeup budget in RM0433 Rev9 section 48.5.8, then obtain physical evidence for its link."
msgstr "平台检查本地分频的可表示性并提供选定源边界，不虚构零误差对端，不要求产品对端预算字段，也不暗中改选时钟源。外部产品必须按 RM0433 Rev9 第 48.5.8 节评估发送端、接收端、量化、线路与唤醒的完整预算，再取得其链路的物理证据。"

msgid "Establish protection before speed and retain failed cleanup"
msgstr "先建立保护再提速，清理失败保留责任"

msgid "The selected joint owner stores one four-byte effect record. It owns the reversible SYSCFG gate, voltage request, shared Flash timing, bus prescalers, PLL configuration/source and USART/I2C/ADC kernel selectors. It does not own consumer requests, buffers, worker tasks or a scheduler."
msgstr "选定的统一 owner 保存一份四字节 effect 记录，拥有可撤回的 SYSCFG gate、电压请求、共享 Flash 时序、总线预分频、PLL 配置与源，以及 USART/I2C/ADC kernel selector。它不拥有 consumer 请求、缓冲区、worker task 或调度器。"

msgid "Validate cold prerequisites, acquire the reversible gate and reject foreign overdrive. Prove VOS1 readiness and Flash LATENCY2/WRHIGHFREQ2 readback."
msgstr "校验冷态前提，取得可撤回 gate 并拒绝外来 overdrive，证明 VOS1 已就绪，以及 Flash LATENCY2/WRHIGHFREQ2 的读回结果。"

msgid "Program the fixed bus dividers and wait 32 ordered RCC observations before programming PLL1. RM0433 section 8.7.8 allows HPRE propagation up to 16 slowest-APB periods; this profile has APB=HCLK/2. Readable HPRE alone is not proof that the effective divider has settled."
msgstr "配置固定总线分频，在配置 PLL1 前等待 32 次有序 RCC 观测。RM0433 第 8.7.8 节允许 HPRE 传播最长占用 16 个最慢 APB 周期，本配置 APB=HCLK/2。能读回 HPRE 不能证明有效分频器已稳定。"

msgid "Establish PLL1, observe readiness, request its source and prove actual SWS before publishing the nominal CPU clock. Acquire and verify the kernel selectors, then start System and selected consumers."
msgstr "建立 PLL1、观察就绪、请求切换时钟源，并在发布名义 CPU 时钟前证明实际 SWS。取得并验证 kernel selector，然后启动 System 与选定 consumer。"

msgid "Stop admission, drain and join consumers, and withdraw System. A failed consumer or System stop retains the clock owner and its protections."
msgstr "关闭准入，排空并 join consumer，然后撤销 System。任一 consumer 或 System 停止失败都保留时钟 owner 及其保护。"

msgid "Restore only owned selectors; each may already be at its baseline or owned target. A foreign selector rejects without clobbering its register. Prove actual HSI selection before disabling PLL or reducing bus, Flash and voltage protections. Clear an effect only after its restoration is observed."
msgstr "仅恢复自有 selector；每个字段可以已处于基线或自有目标值。遇到外来 selector 时拒绝，不覆盖所在寄存器。关闭 PLL 或降低总线、Flash 和电压保护前，必须证明实际已选择 HSI。只有观察到恢复成功后才清除对应 effect。"

msgid "A startup error preserves its primary result while ordered cleanup reports its own failure and retained responsibility. A failed restore keeps the same owner alive for retry; timeout does not authorize releasing unproved effects. This is a single fixed cold profile, not a general-purpose clock tree manager."
msgstr "启动错误保留 primary 结果，有序清理另行报告自己的失败和保留责任。恢复失败使同一 owner 继续存活以供重试；timeout 不能授权释放未被证明已撤回的效果。这是单一固定冷态配置，不是通用时钟树管理器。"

msgid "High-profile Flash pulses require the observed V-cut, VOS1, HCLK, 2WS/WR2 and Cache-off combination. The high owner replaces the fixed-HSI optional Flash timing owner; both must not manage the same timing field. A pulse never retunes ACR. Original voltage, unswapped-bank, region, alignment and fresh-erase requirements still apply. All-FF readback does not prove virgin ECC cells. Busy-bank instruction fetch may stall; an unabortable pulse must settle before return, and failure to prove final withdrawal retains the calling frame through the existing terminal fault path. There is no tight physical deadline promise."
msgstr "高频配置的 Flash 脉冲要求观察到 V 修订、VOS1、HCLK、2WS/WR2 及 Cache-off 组合。高频 owner 替代固定 HSI 的可选 Flash 时序 owner，二者不能管理同一时序字段。脉冲期间不重新调整 ACR；原有电压、未交换 bank、区域、对齐和新鲜擦除要求仍适用。全 FF 读回不能证明 ECC 单元尚未编程。忙 bank 取指可能停顿；不可中止的脉冲必须结束后才能返回，无法证明最终撤回时，现有终止故障路径会保留调用帧。因此不承诺严格物理 deadline。"

msgid "I2C timing requires explicit kernel and electrical bounds; PCLK is not its selected 64 MHz kernel. SPI divider selection uses 99.45 MHz, while its stored nominal source remains 96 MHz. For a 1.5 MHz ceiling it selects /128, rather than /64 from nominal arithmetic. Wire-tail drain and CS release remain required even after the caller's deadline. ADC's 16-bit storage does not establish measured effective resolution or calibrated voltage."
msgstr "I2C 时序需要显式 kernel 和电气边界；PCLK 不是其选定的 64 MHz kernel。SPI 分频使用 99.45 MHz，而保存的名义源仍为 96 MHz。1.5 MHz 上限对应 /128，而非按名义值算出的 /64。即使调用者 deadline 到期，仍必须完成线上尾部排空与 CS 释放。ADC 的 16 位存储不能建立实测有效精度或校准电压的结论。"

msgid "Selection cost, executed scope and next exits"
msgstr "选入成本、已执行范围与下一退出条件"

msgid "Only the high profile emits the joint owner and selects `clock.c`. The four existing fixed-HSI/cache profiles retain their own lifecycle and do not call this owner. The four-byte record is a source-level selected-state fact, not a measured whole-image RAM delta; alignment, retained code and linked ELF costs must be observed separately. No allocation or extra hot-path forwarding layer is introduced by clock selection."
msgstr "仅高频配置生成统一 owner 并选入 `clock.c`。已有四种固定 HSI/cache 配置保留各自生命周期，不调用此 owner。四字节记录是源码层面的选配状态事实，不是整幅镜像 RAM 增量的测量；对齐、代码保留及已链接 ELF 成本须分别观察。选择时钟不引入分配或额外热路径转发层。"

