msgid "Exact empty, UART and peripheral fixtures below; code generation and linking, not hardware"
msgstr "下述精确 empty、UART、peripheral fixture；覆盖代码生成和链接，不是硬件"

msgid "The ARM presets are `fixture-io-evolution-h743-high-empty`, `fixture-io-evolution-h743-high-uart` and `fixture-io-evolution-h743-high-peripherals`. Their maintained inputs are [empty](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/h743_high_assembly/empty.toml), [UART](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/h743_high_assembly/io.toml) and [peripherals](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/h743_high_assembly/peripherals.toml). These records describe this development iteration; they do not establish a clean software candidate, offline reproducibility or physical qualification. The {download}`I/O ledger <io-evolution-execution.csv>` remains the status authority."
msgstr "ARM preset 为 `fixture-io-evolution-h743-high-empty`、`fixture-io-evolution-h743-high-uart` 和 `fixture-io-evolution-h743-high-peripherals`。其维护输入是 [empty](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/h743_high_assembly/empty.toml)、[UART](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/h743_high_assembly/io.toml) 和 [peripherals](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/h743_high_assembly/peripherals.toml)。这些记录描述本开发迭代，不建立 clean 软件候选、离线可复现或物理资格。{download}`I/O 台账 <io-evolution-execution.csv>`仍是状态权威。"

msgid "High Cache-on, continuous H743 DMA, SPI DMA, additional silicon cuts, bootloader handoff and running-clock transitions have separate implementation and acceptance exits. Existing finite DMA modes do not imply these extensions. Physical clock, voltage, temperature, UART, SPI, I2C, ADC and Flash tests remain `not_executed` until connected equipment actually measures the selected image."
msgstr "高频 Cache-on、H743 连续 DMA、SPI DMA、更多硅片修订、bootloader 接管及运行时切换时钟均有独立实施和验收退出条件。已有有限 DMA 模式不能推导出这些扩展。物理时钟、电压、温度、UART、SPI、I2C、ADC 和 Flash 测试均保持 `not_executed`，直到连接的设备实际测量选定镜像。"
